import matplotlib.pyplot as plt

rewards = [2,4,5,7,8,10,12,15,18,20]

episodes = list(range(1,11))

plt.plot(episodes,rewards,marker='o')

plt.title("Episode Reward")

plt.xlabel("Episodes")

plt.ylabel("Reward")

plt.grid(True)

plt.show()


Expected Graph

The graph displays:

X-axis: Episodes (1–10)
Y-axis: Rewards (2–20)
An increasing line showing the agent's learning progress.
